            0.55
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Pause and Ponder"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.096,
            0.563,
            0.867,
            0.61
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "9. Clouds are made up of tiny water droplets or ice crystals floating in the air. Based on what you know about solutions, suspensions and colloids, what type of mixture do you think clouds are and why?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.089,
            0.61,
            0.671,
            0.627
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "10. Why do cities with a lot of smoke and dust in the air often look hazy?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
